# Heated uniformly over the whole width, the stack is one-dimensional: the temperature at any depth is the heat flux times the thermal resistance below it.
# Reference: the sum of thickness over conductivity, exact for this mesh.
title 3 um of oxide directly on the sink
grid dx=0.5 dy=0.25
window width=24 ymin=0 ymax=3
layer sio2 0 3
heater h xmin=-12 xmax=12 ymin=2.75 ymax=3 power=0.1
probe mid x=0 y=1.875
probe low x=3 y=0.375
expect response mid h 56.6123188 1e-7
expect response low h 11.3224638 1e-7
expect peak 8.68055556 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 576
expect response mid h 56.6123188406 1e-9
expect response low h 11.3224637681 1e-9
